        {
          "start_ms": 0,
          "end_ms": 7285,
          "speaker_role_reference": "doctor",
          "reference": "Yeah, OK, great. Well, nice to see you this morning. Um, before we start your appointment, could I confirm your full name and date of birth please?",
          "source_sample_id": "day2_consultation01_doctor.utterance01",
          "source_audio_sha256": "06ba981334432eae576d75a743077b05f5566c4f33ec932d097ec004287426b4"
        },
        {
          "start_ms": 7585,
          "end_ms": 12627,
          "speaker_role_reference": "doctor",
          "reference": "That's perfect, thank you, John. Um, are you in a private place where you're OK to speak at the moment?",
          "source_sample_id": "day2_consultation01_doctor.utterance02",
          "source_audio_sha256": "e081cc23afbbe4f68564d4975e7cfbf2d610659188a5653dff918d973072bcfd"
        },
        {
          "start_ms": 12927,
          "end_ms": 18420,
          "speaker_role_reference": "patient",
          "reference": "Yeah, so I just feel I can't really hear as well as I used to, like my hearing is kind of deteriorating in some way.",
          "source_sample_id": "day2_consultation01_patient.utterance01",
          "source_audio_sha256": "aece20a67e1daaaf06fa77ee7e0693d4ed36545a8eb510f8e78de396869fdde9"
        },
        {
          "start_ms": 18720,
          "end_ms": 23838,
          "speaker_role_reference": "doctor",
          "reference": "Six weeks, OK. Um, and before that have you had any hearing problem at all?",
          "source_sample_id": "day2_consultation01_doctor.utterance03",
          "source_audio_sha256": "af4efd4832516636684c0cfa2e0ef4b78560edc469788dd825c111a501c858ee"
        },
        {
          "start_ms": 24138,
          "end_ms": 30844,
          "speaker_role_reference": "patient",
          "reference": "Um I had something maybe, about a year ago, but it only lasted a couple of days, it wasn't anything as long as this.",
          "source_sample_id": "day2_consultation01_patient.utterance02",
          "source_audio_sha256": "e4f4cb14ebd62a561154412610bf8735773bf6a27893e6a25eddeb81935dc85b"
        },
        {
          "start_ms": 31144,
          "end_ms": 42209,
          "speaker_role_reference": "patient",
          "reference": "Uh nothing major it's just kind of uh it's, it's not the kind of dizziness you get with nausea, like uh not, not proper room spinning or anything like that but just, just a little bit kind of off balance.",
